{"availability":"available","full":"thylinao1/gauntlet","name":"gauntlet","description":"Autonomous red-team for AI applications. Fires attack probes at a chat app, scores it against the OWASP LLM Top 10 (2025), then re-runs the same probes with a runtime guard on. Bundled demo is offline and deterministic: the sample bot leaks 10 of 13 probes unguarded and none with the guard.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-04T10:25:27Z","updated":"2026-08-19T02:36:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gauntlet-seven.vercel.app","topics":["ai-safety","hackathon","llm-security","nextjs","owasp","prompt-injection","red-teaming","typescript"],"demo":"https://gauntlet-seven.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.724Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.724Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.724Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.724Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Gauntlet is an autonomous red-team for AI applications. It fires attack probes at a chat app, streams every attempt and verdict into a live console, scores the app against the OWASP LLM Top 10 (2025), and can switch on a runtime guard and re-run the same probes so the before and after sit side by side.","The bundled demo is offline and deterministic. SupportBot leaks 10 of 13 probes and grades F; with the guard active it leaks none and grades A. Built for the Beyond Tomorrow Hackathon."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thylinao1/gauntlet/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"174c20d09919d216487dd0cf751b2ab4362913d6ab2acbf91f44c32bd9daa19b","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.821Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.821Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Gauntlet is an autonomous red-team for AI applications. It fires attack probes at a chat app, streams every attempt and ve